1
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,070
All I'm saying is, if they took all the money they spent

2
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:09,530
trying to make a decent Hulk movie,

3
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:11,980
they could probably just make an actual Hulk.

4
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,580
That is apt and amusing.

5
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:18,250
I think I shall share that with Amy Farrah Fowler.

6
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,850
She'll appreciate the witticism.

7
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:22,730
Thank you.

8
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:25,770
It'll also help improve her initial impression of you.

9
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:28,920
So what's going on with you two?

10
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:31,750
Well, the status is as it always was.

11
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:33,430
She's a girl. She's a friend.

12
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:34,440
She is not my--

13
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:36,050
please forgive me for doing this--

14
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:37,750
"Girlfriend."

15
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,010
Right, right.

16
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:42,400
So you're still just texting and emailing?

17
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,840
You don't feel any need to hang out with her, you know--

18
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:46,520
