prolonged physical proximity to Amy Farrah Fowler.

24
00:01:00,630 --> 00:01:02,040
Got it.

25
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:04,120
I sense judgment on your part.

26
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,920
No, no.

27
00:01:06,350 --> 00:01:07,820
Maybe a little.

28
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:12,670
May I suggest that your criticism is based on jealousy.

29
00:01:13,090 --> 00:01:15,390
Jealousy? What do I have to be jealous of?

30
00:01:15,390 --> 00:01:19,170
I have a functioning and satisfying relationship with a female.

31
00:01:20,890 --> 00:01:22,820
You have none.

32
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,130
Oh, right. That.

33
00:01:25,130 --> 00:01:27,510
Jealousy is an ugly green-eyed monster--

34
