not unlike the Hulk--

35
00:01:28,890 --> 00:01:31,670
who, by the way, also has a girlfriend.

36
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:34,080
In this iteration, Jennifer Connelly,

37
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:36,630
whom you may recall as the girlfriend of Russell Crowe

38
00:01:36,630 --> 00:01:37,860
