who doesn't believe parallel universes exist.

46
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,880
Probably. What's your point?

47
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:28,750
No point.

48
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:29,920
It's just one of the things

49
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:32,470
that makes one of the mes chuckle.

50
