What makes you chuckle, Leonard?

51
00:02:36,350 --> 00:02:38,670
Hmm, recently?

52
00:02:38,670 --> 00:02:39,880
Not much.

53
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,870
Is it because of the conflict that arises

54
00:02:41,870 --> 00:02:44,210
