57
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:52,740
Um...

58
00:02:52,740 --> 00:02:54,580
Shut up.

59
00:02:55,100 --> 00:02:57,010
You know, when my grandfather died,

60
00:02:57,010 --> 00:02:59,800
and Meemaw was alone, my mom arranged for her

61
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:01,720
to visit a center three times a week

62
