It's very nice.

64
00:03:06,580 --> 00:03:10,370
They discuss current events, play bridge, get a hot meal.

65
00:03:10,370 --> 00:03:11,960
That sounds lovely.

66
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:13,890
It is if you like bridge.

67
00:03:14,980 --> 00:03:16,980
Do you like bridge, Leonard?

68
00:03:17,590 --> 00:03:20,260
Sheldon, I'm just not dating someone right now.

69
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:22,760
I don't need to go to a senior center.

70
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:27,320
