It's not a home.

74
00:03:32,990 --> 00:03:35,580
It's a senior center.

75
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:38,230
We'd never put Meemaw in a home!

76
00:03:39,780 --> 00:03:40,470
Hey, guys.

77
00:03:40,470 --> 00:03:41,850
- Hey.  - Hey.

78
00:03:41,850 --> 00:03:44,830
All right, I'll bow to social pressure: Hey!

79
00:03:47,290 --> 00:03:49,460
Excuse me. That's my girlfriend, Bernadette.

80
00:03:49,460 --> 00:03:51,070
I assigned her her own ringtone--

81
00:03:51,070 --> 00:03:53,080
"Bernadette," By The Four Tops.

82
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,180
Hello, Bernadette.

83
00:03:56,070 --> 00:03:59,110
When I call him, his phone plays "Brown Eyed Girl."

84
