96
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,640
Great. You have a girlfriend, Howard's got a girlfriend,

97
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:29,860
- Sheldon's got a girl... - No, no, no, no!

98
00:04:29,860 --> 00:04:30,990
