154
00:06:30,220 --> 00:06:31,580
Did you know that, Leonard?

155
00:06:31,580 --> 00:06:33,760
- No.  - I did.

156
00:06:34,410 --> 00:06:36,320
I understand that some people find mates

157
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:39,320
