158
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:40,950
Have you tried a bar or tavern?

159
00:06:40,950 --> 00:06:43,200
No, I'm not gonna try to pick up a woman in a bar.

160
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:45,450
