179
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:29,730
Cornucopia.

180
00:07:29,730 --> 00:07:31,010
What a mellifluous word.

181
00:07:31,010 --> 00:07:32,910
Let's make that our word of the day.

182
00:07:32,910 --> 00:07:35,910
Agreed. And we'll use mellifluous tomorrow.

183
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:39,160
Well, I have to void my bladder.

184
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:41,310
It was nice spending this time with you.

185
00:07:41,310 --> 00:07:42,380
Wait.

186
00:07:42,730 --> 00:07:43,930
