191
00:07:49,290 --> 00:07:50,900
Certainly. Good night.

192
00:07:50,900 --> 00:07:52,640
Good night.

193
00:07:57,770 --> 00:07:59,380
Leonard, Leonard, Leonard,

194
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:00,890
Leonard, Leonard, Leonard,

195
00:08:00,890 --> 00:08:02,550
Leonard, Leonard, leonard,

196
00:08:02,550 --> 00:08:04,200
Leonard, Leonard, Leonard,

197
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,790
Leonard, Leonard, Leonard,

198
00:08:05,790 --> 00:08:06,800
Leonard, Leonard,

199
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,860
Leonard, Leonard...

200
00:08:07,860 --> 00:08:09,370
