224
00:08:56,750 --> 00:08:59,890
Well, have you considered telling her how you feel?

225
00:08:59,890 --> 00:09:02,380
Leonard, I'm a physicist, not a hippie.

226
00:09:04,910 --> 00:09:05,980
All right, well, let me see

227
00:09:05,980 --> 00:09:08,940
