231
00:09:16,610 --> 00:09:18,510
Screwed.

232
00:09:21,050 --> 00:09:22,750
There you go.

233
00:09:26,290 --> 00:09:27,000
Amy's right.

234
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,930
