237
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:45,100
You know I'm doing a bowel cleanse for my colonoscopy!

238
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:50,680
I'm like an upside-down volcano here.

239
00:09:53,170 --> 00:09:54,150
Oh, hey.

240
00:09:54,150 --> 00:09:55,870
