263
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:46,510
No, I just... I want what you have.

264
00:10:46,510 --> 00:10:48,440
You know, I want a woman in my life.

265
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:50,110
Holy Moses,

266
00:10:50,110 --> 00:10:54,140
how much liquid can be in one tokus?

267
00:10:57,460 --> 00:10:59,700
To be clear, I meant like Bernadette, not your mother.

268
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:01,320
Yeah, I know what you mean.

269
00:11:05,660 --> 00:11:07,370
Well, I'm off to meet Bernadette's friend.

270
00:11:07,370 --> 00:11:08,640
How do I look?

271
00:11:09,740 --> 00:11:10,940
As if one of the plants

272
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:14,510
